Source: linbox-keyring
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Linbox OS Developers <os@linbox.in>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://github.com/tovganesh/linbox-os
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: linbox-keyring
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linbox OS archive signing keys
 OpenPGP public keys that sign the Linbox OS APT repository
 (https://apt.linbox.in). APT uses them through the Signed-By field in
 /etc/apt/sources.list.d/linbox.sources, so they are trusted for the Linbox
 repository only, never for other repositories.
